{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Twisted Waters",
    "steam_appid": 2900130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/c80311e803354cd754fffc6ee81dd539.avif?t=1737651072\" data-has-big width=800 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/03f7dc8430a2d375353ad9d289f1e800.avif?t=1737651072\" data-has-big width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautiful world where you have the power to control water. Discover what challenges lie in possessing this power and what dangers lurk around the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/c3fb4f06b380dfd278d1e35ec5633bbe.webp?t=1737651072\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could control water in real life? Knock out your enemies with water whips and cause massive waves. In this game, you CAN! Practice your hydrokinesis to unlock new moves. Discover what water is really capable of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/dfa9af0c9c7ba4295669a6fe1e8e38be.webp?t=1737651072\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The water is not like you\u2019ve seen before. This water feels REAL! It\u2019s transparent, it flows and splashes, and it holds great power only a true master could harness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/2705ede0d81091f928eb409175dc74b4.webp?t=1737651072\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the settlements and vast nature around them where every tree, river, and lake is filled with magic, color, and life. Witness what happens to that charm if it is used the wrong way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/b1319c897b0a60f730236bea42868bc3.webp?t=1737651072\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a personal journey with the main character to uncover the twisted truths of this beautiful world. Face the challenges that come with your new power. And prepare yourself to protect what\u2019s dear to you at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/6fd924e30d7fd05e595c24a35c3966a0.webp?t=1737651072\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/c80311e803354cd754fffc6ee81dd539.avif?t=1737651072\" data-has-big width=800 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/03f7dc8430a2d375353ad9d289f1e800.avif?t=1737651072\" data-has-big width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautiful world where you have the power to control water. Discover what challenges lie in possessing this power and what dangers lurk around the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/c3fb4f06b380dfd278d1e35ec5633bbe.webp?t=1737651072\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could control water in real life? Knock out your enemies with water whips and cause massive waves. In this game, you CAN! Practice your hydrokinesis to unlock new moves. Discover what water is really capable of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/dfa9af0c9c7ba4295669a6fe1e8e38be.webp?t=1737651072\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The water is not like you\u2019ve seen before. This water feels REAL! It\u2019s transparent, it flows and splashes, and it holds great power only a true master could harness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/2705ede0d81091f928eb409175dc74b4.webp?t=1737651072\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the settlements and vast nature around them where every tree, river, and lake is filled with magic, color, and life. Witness what happens to that charm if it is used the wrong way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/b1319c897b0a60f730236bea42868bc3.webp?t=1737651072\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a personal journey with the main character to uncover the twisted truths of this beautiful world. Face the challenges that come with your new power. And prepare yourself to protect what\u2019s dear to you at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900130/extras/6fd924e30d7fd05e595c24a35c3966a0.webp?t=1737651072\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Control realistic water in this first-person action-adventure. Master your hydrokinesis and unlock new moves. Embark on a personal journey with the main character navigating this new skill in a beautiful world. At least that is what it was before conflict entered it\u2026",
